# Caravan Town Remade's Trader Johnny and his crate (CIPlay caravan_town_remade_talk, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; offline-written, NOT yet run).
# Points as in its recipe: Johnny leaning on a crate at -14.8 3.8 by the market; his nailed crate (tccrate) at -17.6 4.2, opened
# only after talking to him; his three answers (rope, the quarry journal page, goodbye). The inlet is 1.6 m (ground).
island Caravan Town Remade keep
offset -5.2865 -0.4248
hour 11
weather Calm
expect shown tccrate
expect hidden tcchest

# The crate is nailed before anyone talked to Johnny
use tccrate
expect message Nailed shut
expect shown tccrate
expect hidden tcchest

snap ct_islander Trader Johnny 20 3.5 0.6
use Trader Johnny
expect step 0

# Now the crate opens on his stock
use tccrate
expect message The nails give
expect hidden tccrate
expect shown tcchest
open Johnny's stock
wait 2
expect item Nail 8

# His answers: 1 trade (rope), 2 the quarry (journal), 3 later
use Trader Johnny pick 1
expect message two coils of rope
expect item Rope 2
use Trader Johnny pick 2
expect message ridge, containers
use Trader Johnny pick 3
expect message Trade is patient
